libmatrix/util.cc of glmark2 22c527cb (MIT, Linaro) for Zephyr. Zephyr has no
file system and no process accounting, so the Zephyr arm takes the data
files from the image (glmark2_platform.h), the way upstream's ANDROID arm
takes them from the APK's assets:
  - get_resource: an istream over the linked-in bytes, read in place, with
    seekg (model.cpp skips 3DS chunks); a missing file gives a stream in the
    fail state, as std::ifstream does, which every caller checks.
  - list_files: the linked-in paths whose parent is the directory.
  - get_num_processors: arch_num_cpus().
  - get_process_times: NaN (not measured; a --results cpu line prints nan).
  - get_idle_time: 0.0, upstream's own answer when /proc/uptime is missing.
Applied by CMakeLists.txt to a copy in the build directory.
